{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:36Z","created_by_operation":"op_f60ceac5823a43ef90794993c02d7e75","id":"pg_95cdfb2f37425f6ea3296587b80aead0","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/limecloud-lime-release-notes-md-580022b574cb-6587b80aead0.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_696c8ccfdea95c599cfbf8a21c01d631"],"title":"limecloud/lime/RELEASE_NOTES.md @ 580022b574cb","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:36Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f60ceac5823a43ef90794993c02d7e75"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_1e16cdb2004756b9c25df182aa71559c097d5b3bd48925b4ecd1153aba3bf84f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Lime does not ship AI models itself; users must configure a provider, model, and credential, and model capabilities come from third-party AI service providers configured by the user."},{"claim_ids":["clm_279a5804c7833f721acff616e8d7be6d4de39fd8158bb008f11b4b6385aa236b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Recurring procedures can be encoded as Skills that the agent discovers and runs through MCP or controlled capabilities instead of repeating instructions in every prompt."},{"claim_ids":["clm_39d1d62bd3871c69e00cf9a2fb9d62b6bb92a23ff39b6f9a27c46aad1145182f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Multi-agent collaboration lets users delegate research, implementation, testing, and documentation to different agents while the main Thread keeps shared context, permissions, and review boundaries."},{"claim_ids":["clm_45e1eafa3e3523020f2b42abd0adb12eb2d061372202ed0910b9c9dfd61d5a51"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The stack comprises an Electron desktop shell, a Rust App Server speaking JSON-RPC, a React/TypeScript/Vite frontend, and local capabilities including filesystem, processes, workspaces, artifacts, and persisted state."},{"claim_ids":["clm_4d05830e36ac252827a2ddad612dbe7c65ce80e3ccb614cda60eedceb2013a61"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project is provided for learning and research purposes only, with users responsible for their own use and risk."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6ccd9e3ef46b0cd441776719f50bc33356d2ad4ff9d792e66f5a9c08ad7d9b2c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Within permissions the user grants, the agent can read and edit files, run terminal commands and tests, and call tools, with high-risk actions requiring review or approval."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7822e03f0fe0aa2203eb976f3345e6a83e938a7843ba3c156638ed4724ee9d6a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Only macOS and Windows builds are published; Linux desktop builds are paused, and the Windows installer may trigger SmartScreen because it is unsigned or lacks signing reputation."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e1c9520a081f1d62730db7ac860de41d7c1ea4e1887527aaa249c03372da5a53"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Lime is described as an open-source full-stack desktop AI agent for coding, files, terminals, tools, research, content, multimodal work, and multi-agent workflows."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e2afe9e63891272fa23b5b474f6eb0d30ce488b14f6c70dbb26d94d89b34d243"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Work is projected as Thread, Turn, Item, and reusable artifacts so tasks can be paused, reviewed, restored, and continued; project materials, conversation history, and configuration are kept locally by default."}],"claim_ids":["clm_1e16cdb2004756b9c25df182aa71559c097d5b3bd48925b4ecd1153aba3bf84f","clm_279a5804c7833f721acff616e8d7be6d4de39fd8158bb008f11b4b6385aa236b","clm_39d1d62bd3871c69e00cf9a2fb9d62b6bb92a23ff39b6f9a27c46aad1145182f","clm_45e1eafa3e3523020f2b42abd0adb12eb2d061372202ed0910b9c9dfd61d5a51","clm_4d05830e36ac252827a2ddad612dbe7c65ce80e3ccb614cda60eedceb2013a61","clm_6ccd9e3ef46b0cd441776719f50bc33356d2ad4ff9d792e66f5a9c08ad7d9b2c","clm_7822e03f0fe0aa2203eb976f3345e6a83e938a7843ba3c156638ed4724ee9d6a","clm_e1c9520a081f1d62730db7ac860de41d7c1ea4e1887527aaa249c03372da5a53","clm_e2afe9e63891272fa23b5b474f6eb0d30ce488b14f6c70dbb26d94d89b34d243"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:36Z","created_by_operation":"op_f60ceac5823a43ef90794993c02d7e75","id":"pg_9e812e3e2d885c23a6f381c48bd646e8","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/limecloud-lime-readme-md-580022b574cb-81c48bd646e8.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_c14a4169ad215923b7271cbf65fd38de"],"title":"limecloud/lime/README.md @ 580022b574cb","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:36Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f60ceac5823a43ef90794993c02d7e75"}
